{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, a sacred well sustained Ravy\u2019s hometown with endless blessings. But one day, the well mysteriously ran dry. The land withered, prayers went unanswered, and hope began to fade. Refusing to wait for miracles, Ravy chose to set out on a journey\u2014seeking the legendary land of <strong>Norveranda</strong>, where the source of blessings is said to lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a <strong>narrative-driven adventure</strong> about exploration, gentle encounters, and the search for hope. As you guide Ravy through unfamiliar lands, you\u2019ll uncover secrets, meet kindred spirits, and piece together the story of a world once touched by light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle yet mysterious story about <strong>farewell, pursuit, and homecoming</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through <strong>warm forests, misty swamps, and more</strong>, with new discoveries on every map.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet NPCs, collect items, and unlock interactions</strong>\u2014your choices shape Ravy\u2019s path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather scattered <strong>pearls and memory fragments</strong> to uncover the secret of Norveranda.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>delicate hand-drawn art style</strong> combined with soft, soothing music creates a warm and healing adventure.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986990?t=1761016787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986990?t=1761016787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986990/70ae807c73f2e2adcd86df4b86f1a331f1c205d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761016787","capsule_imagev5":"http